{"seq":2,"slug":"ref-and-reactive","title":"ref 与 reactive","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/ref-and-reactive","wordCount":720,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ref-与-reactive\">ref 与 reactive</h1><h2 id=\"两种响应式-api\">两种响应式 API</h2><p>Vue 3 提供了两种创建响应式数据的核心 API：<code>ref</code> 和 <code>reactive</code>。两者底层都依赖 Proxy，但使用场景和行为有着本质区别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Input[&quot;原始数据&quot;]&#10;    Input --&gt; R1{&quot;数据类型?&quot;}&#10;    R1 -- &quot;基本类型&lt;br/&gt;(string/number/boolean)&quot; --&gt; REF[&quot;ref()&quot;]&#10;    R1 -- &quot;对象/数组&quot; --&gt; Choice{&quot;需求?&quot;}&#10;    Choice -- &quot;保持引用可替换&quot; --&gt; REF&#10;    Choice -- &quot;直接操作属性&quot; --&gt; REACTIVE[&quot;reactive()&quot;]&#10;    REF --&gt; V1[&quot;通过 .value 访问&quot;]&#10;    REACTIVE --&gt; V2[&quot;直接访问属性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Input[\"原始数据\"]\n    Input --&gt; R1{\"数据类型?\"}\n    R1 -- \"基本类型&lt;br/&gt;(string/number/boolean)\" --&gt; REF[\"ref()\"]\n    R1 -- \"对象/数组\" --&gt; Choice{\"需求?\"}\n    Choice -- \"保持引用可替换\" --&gt; REF\n    Choice -- \"直接操作属性\" --&gt; REACTIVE[\"reactive()\"]\n    REF --&gt; V1[\"通过 .value 访问\"]\n    REACTIVE --&gt; V2[\"直接访问属性\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ref</strong>：把任意值包裹进带 <code>.value</code> 的对象，通过 getter/setter 拦截读写，适用于基本类型和需要整体替换引用的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>reactive</strong>：返回对象的深层 Proxy，直接读写属性即可触发更新，但仅接受对象类型。</li>\n<li><strong>响应性丢失</strong>：解构 <code>reactive</code> 对象、替换整个代理引用都会断开追踪，这是选型时的首要约束。</li>\n<li><strong>shallowRef</strong>：只追踪 <code>.value</code> 的替换，不深入内部属性，用于大型数据结构的性能优化。</li>\n<li><strong>toRefs / toRef</strong>：把 <code>reactive</code> 的属性转换为独立 <code>ref</code>，是解决解构丢失响应性的标准手段。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ref-详解\">ref 详解</h2><h3 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h3><p><code>ref</code> 将一个值包裹在一个带有 <code>.value</code> 属性的对象中，使其成为响应式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;console.log(count.value); // 0&#10;count.value++;&#10;console.log(count.value); // 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count.value); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ref-的内部实现\">ref 的内部实现</h3><p><code>ref</code> 内部使用类实例的 getter/setter 来拦截 <code>.value</code> 的读写操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class RefImpl&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  private _value: T;&#10;  private _rawValue: T;&#10;  public dep: Set&lt;ReactiveEffect&gt; = new Set();&#10;&#10;  constructor(value: T) {&#10;    this._rawValue = value;&#10;    this._value = isObject(value) ? reactive(value) : value;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  get value(): T {&#10;    trackRefValue(this);&#10;    return this._value;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  set value(newVal: T) {&#10;    if (hasChanged(newVal, this._rawValue)) {&#10;      this._rawValue = newVal;&#10;      this._value = isObject(newVal) ? reactive(newVal) : newVal;&#10;      triggerRefValue(this);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RefImpl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> _value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> _rawValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  public</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dep</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReactiveEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._rawValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    trackRefValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  set</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newVal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasChanged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newVal, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._rawValue)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._rawValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newVal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newVal) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newVal) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newVal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      triggerRefValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 当 <code>ref</code> 接收一个对象时，内部会自动调用 <code>reactive()</code> 来处理 <code>.value</code>，因此 <code>ref({})</code> 和 <code>reactive({})</code> 在深层响应性上表现一致。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"模板中的自动解包\">模板中的自动解包</h3><p>在 <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> 中使用 <code>ref</code> 时不需要 <code>.value</code>，Vue 的编译器会自动处理解包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const message = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;你好 Vue 3&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;!-- 模板中自动解包，无需 .value --&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;{{ message }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const message = ref&#x3C;string>('你好 Vue 3');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;!-- 模板中自动解包，无需 .value --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;p>{{ message }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"shallowref\">shallowRef</h3><p><code>shallowRef</code> 只对 <code>.value</code> 的替换操作进行追踪，不会对内部嵌套属性进行深层响应式转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { shallowRef, triggerRef } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const state = shallowRef({ count: 0 });&#10;&#10;// ❌ 不会触发更新——内部属性变化不被追踪&#10;state.value.count++;&#10;&#10;// ✅ 替换整个 .value 会触发更新&#10;state.value = { count: 1 };&#10;&#10;// ✅ 手动触发更新&#10;state.value.count++;&#10;triggerRef(state);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { shallowRef, triggerRef } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shallowRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 不会触发更新——内部属性变化不被追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.value.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 替换整个 .value 会触发更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 手动触发更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.value.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">triggerRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"reactive-详解\">reactive 详解</h2><h3 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h3><p><code>reactive</code> 接收一个对象并返回其深层响应式代理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface UserState {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  age: number;&#10;  hobbies: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const state = reactive&lt;UserState&gt;({&#10;  name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;  age: 25,&#10;  hobbies: [&#39;reading&#39;, &#39;coding&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;state.age = 26;&#10;state.hobbies.push(&#39;gaming&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hobbies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UserState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hobbies: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reading'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'coding'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 26</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state.hobbies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gaming'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reactive-的限制\">reactive 的限制</h3><p><code>reactive</code> 存在几个重要的使用限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅支持对象类型</td>\n<td>不能用于 <code>string</code>、<code>number</code> 等基本类型</td>\n<td>使用 <code>ref</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可替换整个对象</td>\n<td>替换会丢失响应式连接</td>\n<td>修改属性而非替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构丢失响应性</td>\n<td>解构后的变量不再是响应式</td>\n<td>使用 <code>toRefs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型限制</td>\n<td>不能用于 <code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code> 以外的集合类型</td>\n<td>使用 <code>ref</code> 包裹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const state = reactive({ count: 0, name: &#39;Vue&#39; });&#10;&#10;// ❌ 解构后丢失响应性&#10;let { count } = state;&#10;count++; // 不会触发更新&#10;&#10;// ❌ 替换整个对象丢失代理&#10;let state2 = reactive({ count: 0 });&#10;state2 = reactive({ count: 1 }); // 旧引用丢失\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 解构后丢失响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不会触发更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 替换整个对象丢失代理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧引用丢失</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"torefs-与-toref\">toRefs 与 toRef</h2><p><code>toRefs</code> 和 <code>toRef</code> 是解决 <code>reactive</code> 解构问题的关键工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { reactive, toRefs, toRef } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const state = reactive({&#10;  count: 0,&#10;  name: &#39;Vue&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// toRefs：将 reactive 对象的每个属性转为 ref&#10;const { count, name } = toRefs(state);&#10;count.value++; // ✅ 保持响应性，同步修改 state.count&#10;&#10;// toRef：转换单个属性&#10;const countRef = toRef(state, &#39;count&#39;);&#10;countRef.value++; // ✅ 保持响应性\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { reactive, toRefs, toRef } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// toRefs：将 reactive 对象的每个属性转为 ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toRefs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 保持响应性，同步修改 state.count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// toRef：转换单个属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> countRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">countRef.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 保持响应性</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    R[&quot;reactive({ a, b, c })&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; |toRefs| TR[&quot;{ a: Ref, b: Ref, c: Ref }&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; |toRef| T1[&quot;Ref (单个属性)&quot;]&#10;    TR --&gt; |解构| D[&quot;const { a, b } = toRefs(state)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; |&quot;.value 修改&quot;| R\">flowchart LR\n    R[\"reactive({ a, b, c })\"]\n    R --&gt; |toRefs| TR[\"{ a: Ref, b: Ref, c: Ref }\"]\n    R --&gt; |toRef| T1[\"Ref (单个属性)\"]\n    TR --&gt; |解构| D[\"const { a, b } = toRefs(state)\"]\n    D --&gt; |\".value 修改\"| R</pre><p>在 composable 函数中返回值时，<code>toRefs</code> 是最常用的模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function useCounter() {&#10;  const state = reactive({&#10;    count: 0,&#10;    doubled: computed(() =&gt; state.count * 2),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  function increment() {&#10;    state.count++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    ...toRefs(state),&#10;    increment,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    doubled: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    state.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toRefs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    increment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ref-vs-reactive-选型指南\">ref vs reactive 选型指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[&quot;选择响应式 API&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt; Q1{&quot;是基本类型?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REF[&quot;使用 ref&quot;]&#10;    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{&quot;需要替换整个对象?&quot;}&#10;    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REF&#10;    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{&quot;对象结构复杂且属性多?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REACTIVE[&quot;使用 reactive&quot;]&#10;    Q3 -- 否 --&gt; USE_REF\">flowchart TD\n    Start[\"选择响应式 API\"]\n    Start --&gt; Q1{\"是基本类型?\"}\n    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REF[\"使用 ref\"]\n    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{\"需要替换整个对象?\"}\n    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REF\n    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{\"对象结构复杂且属性多?\"}\n    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; USE_REACTIVE[\"使用 reactive\"]\n    Q3 -- 否 --&gt; USE_REF</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单计数器</td>\n<td><code>ref</code></td>\n<td>基本类型，语义清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表单数据</td>\n<td><code>reactive</code></td>\n<td>多属性对象，直接操作更方便</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 响应数据</td>\n<td><code>ref</code></td>\n<td>可能需要整体替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>composable 返回值</td>\n<td><code>ref</code></td>\n<td>解构时保持响应性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件内部状态</td>\n<td>均可</td>\n<td>团队统一即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>ref</code> 通过 <code>.value</code> 包裹实现响应式，适用于基本类型和需要替换引用的场景</li>\n<li><code>reactive</code> 直接返回对象的深层 Proxy，使用更简洁但存在解构丢失响应性的问题</li>\n<li><code>shallowRef</code> 只追踪 <code>.value</code> 的替换，适合大型数据结构的性能优化</li>\n<li><code>toRefs</code> / <code>toRef</code> 将 <code>reactive</code> 属性转换为独立的 <code>ref</code>，解决解构问题</li>\n<li>团队应根据一致性原则选定主要 API，推荐优先使用 <code>ref</code> 以获得更好的可预测性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ref 与 reactive","id":"ref-与-reactive"},{"level":2,"text":"两种响应式 API","id":"两种响应式-api"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ref 详解","id":"ref-详解"},{"level":3,"text":"基本用法","id":"基本用法"},{"level":3,"text":"ref 的内部实现","id":"ref-的内部实现"},{"level":3,"text":"模板中的自动解包","id":"模板中的自动解包"},{"level":3,"text":"shallowRef","id":"shallowref"},{"level":2,"text":"reactive 详解","id":"reactive-详解"},{"level":3,"text":"基本用法","id":"基本用法"},{"level":3,"text":"reactive 的限制","id":"reactive-的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"toRefs 与 toRef","id":"torefs-与-toref"},{"level":2,"text":"ref vs reactive 选型指南","id":"ref-vs-reactive-选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于 Proxy 的响应式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/proxy-based-reactivity"},"next":{"title":"computed 与 watch","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/reactivity-system/computed-and-watch"}}